      "Neue Karte im eigenen Takt, Rückseite auf Seite 2",
      "Fünf Darstellungen und Dashboard-Widget"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Example sentences with translation from Tatoeba",
      "Quiz questions with four answers from the Open Trivia DB",
      "Own cards written as “front = back”",
      "A new card at your own interval, back on page 2",
      "Five layouts and a dashboard widget"
    ]
